# Company Management — Frontend Reference & Postman Test Guide

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 1 | **POST** | `/api/college/create_company` | Create a new company |
| 2 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_all_companies` | List companies (filter, sort, search, paginate) |
| 3 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_company/:companyId` | Get single company **with contacts** |
| 4 | **PUT** | `/api/college/update_company/:companyId` | Update company info |
| 5 | **PATCH** | `/api/college/toggle_company_status/:companyId` | Activate / Deactivate |

> **Auth**: JWT cookie from college admin / TPO login required.

---

## 📝 API 1: Create Company

**`POST /api/college/create_company`**

### Request Body

```json
{
  "company_name": "Tata Consultancy Services",
  "company_description": "TCS is a leading global IT services company offering consulting, technology and digital solutions.",
  "company_website": "https://www.tcs.com",
  "industry": "Information Technology",
  "company_logo": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/tcs-logo.png"
}
```

### Fields

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|------------|
| `company_name` | string | ✅ Yes | **Single-line Input** | Min 2, Max 200 chars |
| `company_description` | string | ❌ No | **Textarea** (4-6 rows) | Max 3000 chars |
| `company_website` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** (URL) | Valid URI format |
| `industry` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** or **Dropdown** | Max 100 chars |
| `company_logo` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** (URL) | Valid URI format |

### Industry Suggestions (for dropdown/autocomplete)
`Information Technology`, `Banking & Finance`, `E-commerce`, `Healthcare`, `Automobile`, `Manufacturing`, `Consulting`, `Telecom`, `Media`, `Education`, `Retail`, `Logistics`, `Other`

### Success Response (201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Company added successfully",
  "data": {
    "company_id": "c1o2m3p4-...",
    "college_id": "col-1234-...",
    "company_name": "Tata Consultancy Services",
    "company_description": "TCS is a leading global IT services...",
    "company_website": "https://www.tcs.com",
    "industry": "Information Technology",
    "company_logo": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/tcs-logo.png",
    "company_status": "active",
    "created_at": "2026-03-02T14:30:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T14:30:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

### Error Cases
| Status | When | Message |
|--------|------|---------|
| 409 | Duplicate name in same college | `"Company "TCS" already exists in your college"` |
| 422 | Validation failure | Field-level error details |

---

## 📝 API 2: List All Companies

**`GET /api/college/get_all_companies`**

### Query Parameters

| Param | Type | Required | Default | Notes |
|-------|------|----------|---------|-------|
| `company_status` | string | ❌ | all | `active` or `inactive` |
| `industry` | string | ❌ | — | Partial match (ILIKE) |
| `search` | string | ❌ | — | Searches name and industry |
| `sort_by` | string | ❌ | `created_at` | `company_name`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `industry` |
| `sort_order` | string | ❌ | `desc` | `asc` or `desc` |
| `page` | integer | ❌ | 1 | Pagination |
| `limit` | integer | ❌ | 20 | Max 100 |

### Example Requests
```
GET /api/college/get_all_companies?page=1&limit=20
GET /api/college/get_all_companies?company_status=active&sort_by=company_name&sort_order=asc
GET /api/college/get_all_companies?search=tcs&industry=IT
```

### Response (200) — Each item includes `contacts_count` and `jobs_count`
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Companies retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "company_id": "c1o2m3p4-...",
      "company_name": "Tata Consultancy Services",
      "industry": "Information Technology",
      "company_status": "active",
      "company_website": "https://www.tcs.com",
      "company_logo": "https://...",
      "contacts_count": 2,
      "jobs_count": 3,
      "created_at": "2026-03-02T14:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ],
  "pagination": { "page": 1, "limit": 20, "total": 15, "totalPages": 1 }
}
```

