## 📝 API 4: Update Company

**`PUT /api/college/update_company/:companyId`**

### Request Body (at least 1 field required)
```json
{
  "company_description": "Updated description for TCS",
  "company_website": "https://www.tcs.com/careers"
}
```

All fields same as create but **all optional**. Min 1 field required.

---

## 📝 API 5: Toggle Company Status

**`PATCH /api/college/toggle_company_status/:companyId`**

### Request Body
```json
{ "company_status": "inactive" }
```

| Status Value | Display | Action |
|-------------|---------|--------|
| `active` | 🟢 Active | Company is visible and usable |
| `inactive` | 🔴 Inactive | Company hidden from new job creation |

---

## 🔄 Integration with Other APIs

```
┌─────────────────┐
│    COMPANIES     │ ← YOU ARE HERE
│  (CRUD + Status) │
└────────┬────────┘
         │ company_id (FK)
         ├──────────────────────────┐
         ▼                          ▼
┌──────────────────┐      ┌──────────────────┐
│ COMPANY CONTACTS │      │  JOB POSTINGS    │
│ (Next to build)  │      │  (Future)        │
│ Add/List/Update  │      │ Links company to │
│ Toggle contacts  │      │ placement drives │
└──────────────────┘      └────────┬─────────┘
                                   │ job_id (FK)
                          ┌────────┼────────┐
                          ▼        ▼        ▼
                    Positions  Criteria  Rounds
                    ▼
              Applications → Results → Placements
```

### How Company APIs connect:
1. **Company Contacts** (next) — `company_contacts.company_id` → links to `companies.company_id`
2. **Job Postings** (future) — `job_postings.company_id` → links to company. Must select an active company when creating a job
3. **Placement Results** (future) — `placement_results.company_id` → final placement record references the company
4. **Feedback** (future) — `placement_feedback.company_id` → students rate the company experience

### Frontend Navigation Flow:
```
Company List Page → Click company → Company Detail Page
                                   ├── Company Info (editable)
                                   ├── Contacts Tab (CRUD - next API)
                                   └── Jobs Tab (list of jobs by this company - future)
```

