## 🎨 Frontend UI Recommendations

### Company List Page
- **Header**: "Company Management" + "Add Company" button (top right)
- **Filter bar**: Status dropdown + Industry filter + Search input + Sort dropdown
- **Table columns**: Logo (small thumbnail), Name, Industry, Status (badge), Contacts, Jobs, Actions
- **Actions**: View, Edit, Toggle Status
- **Logo column**: Show thumbnail or default placeholder icon if no logo

### Create/Edit Company Form (Modal or Page)
| # | Field | UI Element | Notes |
|---|-------|------------|-------|
| 1 | Company Name | **Single-line input** | Required, autofocus, 2-200 chars |
| 2 | Industry | **Dropdown with search** or **Single-line input** | Suggestions list, allow custom |
| 3 | Website | **Single-line input** (URL) | Placeholder: `https://example.com` |
| 4 | Logo URL | **Single-line input** (URL) | Show preview if valid URL entered |
| 5 | Description | **Textarea** (4-6 rows) | Optional, show char counter (max 3000) |

### Company Detail Page
- **Header**: Company name + logo + status badge + Edit/Toggle buttons
- **Info section**: Description, website (clickable link), industry
- **Stats cards**: Total Contacts, Total Jobs Posted
- **Tabs**:
  - **Contacts** — CRUD table (Company Contacts API — next to build)
  - **Job Postings** — List of jobs by this company (future)

### Frontend Validation Rules

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| `company_name` | Required, min 2 chars, max 200 chars, trim whitespace |
| `company_description` | Optional, max 3000 chars, show remaining count |
| `company_website` | Optional, must be valid URL if provided (starts with http/https) |
| `industry` | Optional, max 100 chars |
| `company_logo` | Optional, must be valid URL if provided |
| `company_status` | Required for toggle, must be `active` or `inactive` |
